d.strike.guard [b18b05] = 格挡可全部挡下，护界挡下一半
# en: Guard stops all of it (less from a Guard that has just guarded), Ward half
d.strike.guardLeak [272844] = 格挡可全部挡下（刚格挡过又格挡则挡得较少），护界挡下一半
# en: Stop all Strike damage and half of spell damage this exchange.
d.guard [5ff6ca] = 本回合挡下全部打击伤害和一半的法术伤害。
# en: Still guarding, and tiring: stop {pct}% of Strike damage and half of spell damage this exchange.
d.guard.tired [54705b] = 仍在格挡，但已疲惫：本回合挡下 {pct}% 的打击伤害和一半的法术伤害。
# en: Stop all Strike damage and half of spell damage this exchange. Guarding again {when} stops only {pct}% of a Strike.
d.guard.fresh [308ff8] = 本回合挡下全部打击伤害和一半的法术伤害。{when}再次格挡，只能挡下一次打击的 {pct}%。
# en: straight after
d.guard.straightAfter [e541a9] = 紧接着
# en: within {n} exchanges
d.guard.within [af17d4] = {n} 个回合内
# en: Recover up to {n} flux after attacks, capped at capacity; recovering Mana breaks Shadowstep before this exchange's attacks.
d.reclaim [bb6d42] = 在攻击结算后回收至多 {n} 点游离法力，不超过上限；回收法力会在本回合的攻击之前打破影步。
# en: {action} {spell}. {text}
d.channelAction [0f2284] = {action}{spell}。{text}
# en: Cannot act or be hurt this exchange; then thaw.
d.frozen [581faa] = 本回合无法行动，也不会受伤；之后解冻。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage.
d.dealSpell [7e711a] = 造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage{pierce}.
d.starlight.release [ba5f1e] = 造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害{pierce}。
# en: ; Ward doesn't stop it
d.starlight.releasePierce [7d8227] = ；护界挡不住
# en: Charge the release to {dmg} spell damage{pierce}. Further Holds add no damage.
d.starlight.hold [e6beb4] = 将释放蓄至 {dmg} 点法术伤害{pierce}。继续蓄持不再增加伤害。
# en:  that Ward doesn't stop
d.starlight.holdPierce [e63892] = ，且护界挡不住
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage, plus {extra} from the Holds that gets through Guard and Ward.
d.wildfire.releaseHeld [ce1252] = 造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，另加蓄持积攒的 {extra} 点，这部分能穿透格挡与护界。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage to them and {self} to yourself; the Release gains {per} that gets through Guard and Ward.
d.wildfire.hold [edc2b7] = 对对方造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，对自己造成 {self} 点；释放时多 {per} 点能穿透格挡与护界的伤害。
# en: Heal {n} HP from damage dealt.
d.siphon.release [6444ac] = 按造成的伤害治疗 {n} 点生命。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage; bank actual damage for healing.
d.siphon.hold [c836c7] = 造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害；实际造成的伤害存起来用于治疗。
# en: Gain up to {n} ready Mana, capped at capacity.
d.moonwell.release [ddd74e] = 获得至多 {n} 点可用法力，不超过上限。
# en: Bank {n} more Mana; Release makes it ready.
d.moonwell.hold [2b54fa] = 再存入 {n} 点法力；释放后即可使用。
# en: Turn on a {n}-point absorb pool, used up across hits.
d.lodestar.release [c44559] = 开启一个 {n} 点的吸收池，在多次攻击中逐渐耗尽。
# en: Bank {n} more absorb; the bank soaks up hits while you hold.
d.lodestar.hold [1278d0] = 再存入 {n} 点吸收；蓄持期间，存量会替你吸收攻击。
# en: {effect} each exchange end; reduce each hit by {reduce}; ends after {threshold} HP damage taken.{burst}
d.construct [683601] = 每回合结束时{effect}；每次受击减免 {reduce} 点；累计承受 {threshold} 点伤害后消失。{burst}
# en: Heal {n} HP
d.construct.heal [3e1ba5] = 治疗 {n} 点生命
# en: Deal {n} physical damage before defenses
d.construct.strike [c98e9d] = 在防御前造成 {n} 点物理伤害
# en: Deal {n} spell damage before defenses
d.construct.spell [6aecba] = 在防御前造成 {n} 点法术伤害
# en:  On ending: {n} spell damage to both sides before defenses.
d.construct.burst [013006] = 消失时：在防御前对双方各造成 {n} 点法术伤害。
# en: {text} Forbidden: alignment −small each cast; witnessed casts are reported.
d.forbidden [723e0d] = {text}禁咒：每次施放，立场小幅偏向空洞；被人目击的施放会遭举报。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage before defenses. Guard halves it; Ward stops it.
d.spellHit [778ecc] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害。格挡减半；护界完全挡下。
# en: Deal {dmg} physical damage before defenses. Guard stops it; Ward halves it.
d.physicalHit [fe27a3] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点物理伤害。格挡完全挡下；护界减半。
# en: Opponent commits first for {n} subsequent exchanges.
d.foresight [3d1490] = 接下来 {n} 个回合，对手必须先出招。
# en: At the end of the exchange, heal {n} HP, unless you take any damage this exchange.{exposes}
d.mend [6a05ec] = 回合结束时治疗 {n} 点生命，前提是本回合没有受到任何伤害。{exposes}
# en:  Breaks your own Shadowstep.
d.mend.exposes [33ddae] = 会打破你自己的影步。
# en: With observers: earn {n} Renown at settlement. Casts stack, with Rapport's, up to {cap} Renown a fight.
d.glamour [580fc1] = 有观众时：结算时获得 {n} 点声望。可叠加施放，与“投契”合计每场至多 {cap} 点声望。
# en: For the next {n} exchanges, commit {actions} basic actions as one bundle each exchange.
d.haste [6a38b3] = 接下来 {n} 个回合，每回合可把 {actions} 个基础行动组合成一次出招。
# en: Evade attacks and every opposing spell effect for {n} exchanges including this one; breaks before the hits land on any exchange you attack or recover Mana.
d.shadowstep [a23a8c] = 包括本回合在内的 {n} 个回合中，闪避攻击和对方的一切法术效果；在你攻击或回收法力的回合，影步会在攻击命中之前破除。
# en: This exchange: block every opposing spell (damage, Torment, Extraction, Seal, Compel) and half of each Strike.
d.ward [89d3d2] = 本回合：挡下对方的一切法术（伤害、折磨、汲取、封缄、强令）以及每次打击的一半。
# en: Start channel. Release for {dmg} spell damage, or {charged} after a Hold{pierce}. Holds cost {cost} Mana.
d.starlight [88ab27] = 开始引导。释放可造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，蓄持一次后为 {charged} 点{pierce}。每次蓄持消耗 {cost} 点法力。
# en: , which Ward doesn't stop
d.starlight.pierce [4202b2] = ，且护界挡不住
# en: Erase all opposing flux. Ward and Shadowstep stop it.
d.seal [f0edf0] = 抹去对方全部游离法力。护界与影步可以挡下。
# en: Start channel{ignite}. Each Hold: {hold} spell damage to them, {self} to you, and +{per} on the Release that gets through Guard and Ward. Release: {release} spell damage plus what the Holds added. Before defenses.
d.wildfire [254438] = 开始引导{ignite}。每次蓄持：对对方造成 {hold} 点法术伤害，对自己造成 {self} 点，并让释放多出 {per} 点能穿透格挡与护界的伤害。释放：造成 {release} 点法术伤害，再加上蓄持积攒的部分。以上均为防御前数值。
# en: , dealing {n} spell damage now
d.wildfire.ignite [1bf9c0] = ，立即造成 {n} 点法术伤害
# en: Public hit of {n} spell damage before defenses two exchanges later{pierce}.
d.omen [da2977] = 两个回合后公开降下 {n} 点法术伤害（防御前）{pierce}。
# en: ; only evading stops it
d.omen.evadeOnly [66abb8] = ；只有闪避才能躲开
# en: ; Guard and Ward don't stop it
d.omen.guardWard [9064c7] = ；格挡与护界都挡不住
# en: ; Ward doesn't stop it
d.omen.ward [7d8227] = ；护界挡不住
# en: ; Guard doesn't stop it
d.omen.guard [3af4bc] = ；格挡挡不住
# en: Steal up to {n} Crowns; alignment −tiny.
d.sleight [7ed810] = 偷取至多 {n} 克朗；立场略微偏向空洞。
# en: Deal {dmg} cold spell damage before defenses; opposing Flame or Wildfire damage cancels with it.
d.hoarfrost [b5a08d] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点寒冰法术伤害；对方的火焰或野火伤害会与之相互抵消。
# en: No combat effect.
d.noEffect [5d3a9f] = 在战斗中没有效果。
# en: Block all opposing damage this exchange, then {a}, {b} and {c} of it over the next three exchanges. Spell effects still land.
d.brace [256a35] = 本回合挡下对方的全部伤害，之后三个回合依次挡下 {a}、{b} 和 {c}。法术效果照常生效。
# en: With observers, spend up to 10 Crowns automatically; earn 1 Renown per 2 spent at settlement, up to {cap} Renown a fight with Glamour's.
d.rapport [3c584f] = 有观众时，自动花费至多 10 克朗；结算时每花 2 克朗获得 1 点声望，与“魅影”合计每场至多 {cap} 点声望。
# en: Pay {hp} HP; gain up to {n} ready Mana, capped at capacity.
d.purify [0850c9] = 支付 {hp} 点生命；获得至多 {n} 点可用法力，不超过上限。
# en: Next three exchanges: consecutive Strikes add {n} damage that gets through Guard. Any other action ends the bonus.
d.tailwind [86a6d1] = 接下来三个回合：连续打击额外造成 {n} 点能穿透格挡的伤害。做任何别的行动都会中断加成。
# en: Arm once-per-fight rescue: first knockout freezes you through the following exchange, then you thaw with {n} HP.
d.rime [21a421] = 布下每场一次的保命术：第一次被击倒时，你会被冻住直到下一个回合结束，然后以 {n} 点生命解冻。
# en: Return incoming damaging spells this exchange in full; reflected hits cannot bounce again.
d.reflect [8c76d5] = 本回合将来袭的伤害法术全数反弹；被反弹的攻击不会再弹回来。
# en: Return incoming damaging spells in full this exchange and the next {n}; reflected hits cannot bounce again.
d.reflect.more [5dc506] = 本回合及之后的 {n}，将来袭的伤害法术全数反弹；被反弹的攻击不会再弹回来。
# en: Start channel: bank {n} Mana now and {more} per free Hold; Release makes it ready.
d.moonwell [521190] = 开始引导：现在存入 {n} 点法力，之后每次蓄持再存 {more} 点；释放后即可使用。
# en: Start channel: bank {n} absorb now and {more} per free Hold. The bank soaks up hits while you hold; Release turns what's left into a pool used up across hits.
d.lodestar [09b864] = 开始引导：现在存入 {n} 点吸收，之后每次蓄持再存 {more} 点。蓄持期间，存量替你吸收攻击；释放后，剩余部分化作一个在多次攻击中逐渐耗尽的吸收池。
# en: Cards/story only; not a combat cast.
d.toll [12e20a] = 仅用于卡牌与剧情；战斗中无法施放。
# en: For three exchanges including this one, each opposing action pays {n} HP, bypassing hit reductions. Ward and Shadowstep stop it.
d.torment [a29509] = 包括本回合在内的三个回合里，对方每做一个行动都要付出 {n} 点生命，无视减伤。护界与影步可以挡下。
# en: Move up to {n} of their ready Mana into your flux; your Mana plus flux can't pass capacity. Ward and Shadowstep stop it.
d.extraction [3cbc57] = 把对方至多 {n} 点可用法力转为你的游离法力；你的法力加游离法力不能超过上限。护界与影步可以挡下。
# en: Start and each Hold deal {n} spell damage before defenses. Release heals actual damage dealt; Holds cost {cost} Mana.
d.siphon [10e812] = 开始时及每次蓄持，在防御前造成 {n} 点法术伤害。释放时按实际造成的伤害治疗；每次蓄持消耗 {cost} 点法力。
# en: Their action this exchange becomes their last move, and so does their next {n}: forced and shown in advance. If they can't repeat it, their turn is lost.
d.compel.immediate [2b5b0b] = 对方本回合的行动变成其上一招，接下来的 {n} 也是如此：被迫重复，并提前公开。若无法重复，该回合作废。
# en: For the next {n}, their action is replaced with their last legal public action. No history: cancel.
d.compel [937b87] = 接下来的 {n}，对方的行动会被替换为其上一个合法的公开行动。没有可重复的行动则作废。
# en: This exchange and the next, damage you actually take also gives you twice that in ready Mana, capped at capacity.
d.eclipse [bcd0f9] = 本回合与下一回合，你实际受到的伤害会转化为两倍的可用法力，不超过上限。
# en: For the rest of the fight, spell Mana costs are paid as HP at 1 HP per 2 Mana (healing still costs Mana); no flux from HP payments.
